# Fridges, members, invites, items and deductions (API.md §6, §7). Sign in first with dev-login (Development only);
# the cookie is kept between requests. Replace the ids with ones from your database (recipes_b5 for task B5).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5105/api/v1
@fridgeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@inviteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@token = replace-with-an-invite-token
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@deductionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Sign in (dev-login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "email": "anna@test.local", "nickname": "anna" }

### My fridges
GET {{baseUrl}}/fridges

### Create a fridge (I become its owner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridges
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "name": "Działka" }

### A fridge with its members (404 fridge.not_found for non-members)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}

### Rename (owner; 403 fridge.owner_required for members)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "name": "Kuchnia" }

### Delete (owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Create an invite link (owner; valid for 7 days)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/invites
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Active invites (owner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/invites

### Revoke an invite (owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/invites/{{inviteId}}
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Preview an invite (404 invite.not_found when expired or revoked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invites/{{token}}

### Join (idempotent for members)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invites/{{token}}/accept
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Remove a member (owner), or leave (member; 400 fridge.owner_cannot_leave for the owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/members/{{userId}}
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/items

### Add an item (package in base units, percent 0–100)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "packageAmount": 330, "remainingPercent": 100, "note": null }

### Edit an item (version from the last read; 409 concurrency.conflict when stale; 0 % deletes → 204)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "packageAmount": 330, "remainingPercent": 70, "note": null, "version": 0 }

### Remove an item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/items/{{itemId}}
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Deduct a cooked recipe (most-used package first; shortfalls reported)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/deductions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "recipeId": null, "variantId": null, "lines": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "amount": 200 }] }

### Undo (409 deduction.items_changed / deduction.already_undone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/deductions/{{deductionId}}/undo
X-Requested-With: fetch
